---
source: crates/zeff-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: refused
---
$ zeff explain Z9999
error: no code `Z9999`
  = help: `zeff explain` lists the codes this version explains

$ zeff explain mean
error: `mean` is not a code: a code is Z or W and four digits, such as Z0402
  = help: `zeff explain` lists the codes; `zeff help mean` prints the page of a function

$ zeff explain Z0101 Z0102
error: `zeff explain` takes one code, such as `zeff explain Z0402`, or none to list them

run `zeff help` to see the commands

$ zeff --format json explain Z9999
error: no code `Z9999`
  = help: `zeff explain` lists the codes this version explains
